  <History Date="18-03-08" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="02-02-09" Author="D4 Personality Fixer 2009" Comment="Changed Function Names" />
  <History Date="09-03-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited for version 6." />
  <History Date="06-04-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added preset palettes in response to customer bug report" />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="04-09-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised conditionals.  Added function index.  Recreated palettes.  Revised highlight/lowlight" />
  <History Date="16-12-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised Atlabase ID's for Rain ON modes and added missing ID's for Rain OFF." />
  <History Date="25-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added physical pan/tilt limits.  Changed split colours to fixed range and added separate index ranges." />
  <History Date="25-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised shutter.  Revised speed controls." />
  <History Date="07-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo swatches.  Added channel counts to mode names." />
